# The root Dockerfile builds only the browser gateway; keep the build context
# to the paths it copies (service sources + the shared lib/browser files the
# gateway imports). Every shared file the gateway imports must be listed here
# and COPYed in the Dockerfile.
*
!lib/browser/contract.ts
!lib/browser/domains.ts
!services/browser-gateway/package.json
!services/browser-gateway/src
